<section class="section">
  <h1>Welcome to Saguaro Creek PTSA!</h1>
  <p>
    The PTSA plays a vital role in bringing families, staff, and students together to create
    meaningful change. Our work is guided by a shared mission: to make every child’s potential a
    reality by engaging and empowering families and communities to advocate for all children.
    Our motto, “{{ site.motto }}”, reflects our deep commitment to building a connected, inclusive,
    and empowering school community. Together, we celebrate our Sidewinder spirit and strive to make
    Saguaro Creek K-8 a place where every student can thrive!
  </p>
  <p class="callout">
    Together, families, students, staff, and community members help create meaningful programs,
    memorable events, and additional support for our Sidewinders.
  </p>
