<section class="section">
  <h2>Volunteer!</h2>
  <p>
    There will be many opportunities to volunteer with the PTSA! We will have planning committees,
    will need special event volunteers, and more. The best way to find out about these opportunities
    is to attend our meetings. We do understand that not every member can attend meetings —
    not every volunteer role is front and center; sometimes the most important work happens behind
    the scenes. 💚
  </p>
</section>

